What does this print?

```javascript
class Shape {
  area() { return 0; }
  describe() { return `area ${this.area()}`; }
}
class Square extends Shape {
  constructor(side) {
    super();
    this.side = side;
  }
  area() { return this.side ** 2; }
}
console.log(new Square(3).describe(), new Shape().describe());
```

